      "hizbQuarter": 50,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 772,
      "text": "Allah did not ordain any such thing as the Bahīrah, Sā’ibah, Wasīlah, and Hām [i.e., dedicated camels to idols][69]. Rather those who disbelieve fabricate lies against Allah, and most of them do not understand.",
